        "architecture_used": "This project uses the Model-View-ViewModel (MVVM) architecture. It separates the business logic, user interface, and data access. ViewModels (e.g., UploadViewModel, AvatarViewModel) handle all business logic and state, while Views (e.g., UploadScreen, PhotoGrid) are responsible for the display. Models (e.g., PhotoModel, Avatar) represent data.",
