2024-09-12 18:20:26,479 - root - INFO - ### Identify Components:

1. **Status Bar:**
   - Position: Top of the UI.
   - Includes: Time (9:41 AM), indicators for Wi-Fi, carrier signal strength, and battery status.

2. **Title Text:**
   - Text: "Which features do you like the most?"
   - Position: Below the status bar, centered horizontally.

3. **Feature Option - AI Art:**
   - Container: White background with a blue border, slightly rounded corners.
   - Icon: Located on the right side, depicting an art icon.
   - Text: 
     - Title: "AI Art"
     - Subtitle: "Elevate your pictures with advanced face swapping."
   - Position: First option below the title text, spanning the width of the screen.

4. **Feature Option - AI Enhance:**
   - Container: White background with slightly rounded corners.
   - Icon: Located on the right side, depicting an enhancement icon (a magic wand).
   - Text:
     - Title: "AI Enhance"
     - Subtitle: "Enhance your image quality."
   - Position: Second option below "AI Art," spanning the width of the screen.

5. **Feature Option - AI Avatar:**
   - Container: White background with slightly rounded corners.
   - Icon: Located on the right side, depicting an avatar icon.
   - Text:
     - Title: "AI Avatar"
     - Subtitle: "Transform your selfie into diverse avatar styles."
   - Position: Third option below "AI Enhance," spanning the width of the screen.

6. **Feature Option - Text to Image:**
   - Container: White background with slightly rounded corners.
   - Icon: Located on the right side, depicting a text-to-image transformation icon.
   - Text:
     - Title: "Text to Image"
     - Subtitle: "Turn text into personalized avatars."
   - Position: Fourth option below "AI Avatar," spanning the width of the screen.

7. **Feature Option - Face Me:**
   - Container: White background with slightly rounded corners.
   - Icon: Located on the right side, depicting a face icon.
   - Text:
     - Title: "Face Me"
     - Subtitle: "Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text."
   - Position: Fifth option below "Text to Image," spanning the width of the screen.

8. **Next Button:**
   - Text: "Next"
   - Background color: Blue
   - Text color: White
   - Position: Centered horizontally at the bottom of the feature options.

9. **Advertisement Section:**
   - Position: Below the "Next" button.
   - Includes: Ad placeholder with blurred content and a loading bar/text.

### Describe Functionality:

1. **Status Bar:**
   - Displays the current time, network, and battery status.

2. **Title Text:**
   - Asks the user to choose which features they like the most.

3. **Feature Option - AI Art:**
   - Function: When selected, likely navigates the user to the AI Art feature to elevate pictures using face swapping technology.

4. **Feature Option - AI Enhance:**
   - Function: When selected, likely navigates the user to the AI Enhance feature for image quality enhancement.

5. **Feature Option - AI Avatar:**
   - Function: When selected, likely navigates the user to the AI Avatar feature to transform selfies into avatars.

6. **Feature Option - Text to Image:**
   - Function: When selected, likely navigates the user to the Text to Image feature for personalized avatars from text.

7. **Feature Option - Face Me:**
