ow, likely after making a selection.\n\n9. **Advertisement Section:**\n   - Function: Displays an advertisement, generates revenue for the app.\n\n### Detect Repetition:\n\n1. **Feature Options:**\n   - Repeated Components: All five features (AI Art, AI Enhance, AI Avatar, Text to Image, Face Me) have a similar structure.\n   - Structure: Each has a container with white background and rounded corners, title text, subtitle text, and an icon on the right side.\n   - Function: Selection likely navigates to corresponding feature customization or application page.\n\n2. **Icons:**\n   - Each feature option includes a distinct icon on the right side, but the placement and function pattern are repeated across all five options.\n\nThe consistent design ensures visual uniformity and intuitive navigation. ".\n Some information about figma data is: \n  Note: The colors in figma api data is in the form of RGBA fromat so make so add accurate colors in code \nabsoluteBoundingBox: Describes the absolute position and size of the element in the frame, here position is given in the form  of x and y coordinated with respect to the screen, so place the components at proper positions \n No need to generate code for Status bar showing battery, time, etc.\nMake components reusable instead of hardcoding repetative components to avoid duplicate code\nGenerated code must contain some explanatory comments.\nThe generated output must not contain any unwanted commentary or explanation of the output. \n Also Make sure the generated code doesnot include deprecated snippets or imports also the generated code is without any error.'), type='text'), ImageURLContentBlock(image_url=ImageURL(url='https://hutouchbucket.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/427bed4d-dcb6-4dc6-8012-88b4d091ddee.png?X-Amz-Expires=43200&X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEH0aCXVzLWVhc3QtMiJHMEUCIQC4NSDUhrW%2BqjXxmFSLwLwYPQ8XM1SPn7t0T%2F0eBlwBVAIgOUdujtl2eu5fjYNmLdWbY6pLraB5cbaE6Q%2FKkGq4hj0q0wUIpv%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAEGgw