utton.\n   - **Gray Rectangles (Ad Placeholder):** Below the "AD" label, full width of the screen, indicating an ad.\n\n6. **Loading Text:**\n   - **"Loading..."**: Centered inside the bottom ad placeholder.\n\n7. **Home Indicator (iPhone Design):**\n   - **Horizontal Black Bar**: Centered at the bottom of the screen.\n\n**Describe Functionality:**\n\n1. **Navigation Bar:**\n   - Displays current time and device status.\n\n2. **Title Text:**\n   - Informs the user about the current screen’s purpose (selecting favorite features).\n\n3. **Feature Buttons:**\n   - **AI Art:** Elevate pictures with advanced face swapping. Select button to choose this feature.\n   - **AI Enhance:** Enhance image quality. Select button to choose this feature.\n   - **AI Avatar:** Transform selfies into diverse avatar styles. Select button to choose this feature.\n   - **Text to Image:** Turn text into personalized avatars. Select button to choose this feature.\n   - **Face Me:** Feature description placeholder. Select button to choose this feature.\n\n4. **Next Button:**\n   - Proceeds to the next step after selecting a preferred feature.\n\n5. **Advertisement Section:**\n   - Placeholder for ads content, with a loading message indicating ad content is being fetched.\n\n6. **Loading Text:**\n   - Denotes ad content is loading.\n\n7. **Home Indicator:**\n   - iPhone UI element to indicate swipe functionality for home navigation.\n\n**Detect Repetition:**\n\n1. **Feature Buttons Repetition:**\n   - Each of the five button boxes follows the exact same structure:\n     - A main action text.\n     - A subtitle describing the feature.\n     - An icon at the right end.\n\n2. **Icons in Feature Buttons:**\n   - All icons serve as graphical representations to visually distinguish each feature but functionally act as part of their respective buttons. ".\n Some information about figma data is: \n  Note: The colors in figma api data is in the form of RGBA fromat so make so add accurate colors in code