2024-09-12 18:37:21,905 - root - INFO - ### Identify Components:

1. **Header Section:**
   - Status Bar: Contains time (9:41), cellular signal icon, WiFi icon, and battery icon. Located at the top.
   - Question Text: "Which features do you like the most?" Positioned below the status bar, centered horizontally.

2. **Feature List Items (5 items):**
   - **AI Art:**
     - Container: Rectangular box with blue border. Positioned below the question text, taking the full width minus margins.
     - Title: "AI Art" located at the top-left inside the container.
     - Description: "Elevate your pictures with advanced face swapping." positioned below the title.
     - Icon: Small icon of a star inside a box. Positioned at the top-right inside the container.
   - **AI Enhance:**
     - Container: Rectangular box with no border. Positioned below "AI Art", taking the full width minus margins.
     - Title: "AI Enhance" located at the top-left.
     - Description: "Enhance your image quality" positioned below the title.
     - Icon: Small icon of a pencil. Positioned at the top-right inside the container.
   - **AI Avatar:**
     - Container: Rectangular box with no border. Positioned below "AI Enhance", taking the full width minus margins.
     - Title: "AI Avatar" located at the top-left.
     - Description: "Transform your selfie into diverse avatar styles" positioned below the title.
     - Icon: Small icon of an avatar. Positioned at the top-right inside the container.
   - **Text to Image:**
     - Container: Rectangular box with no border. Positioned below "AI Avatar", taking the full width minus margins.
     - Title: "Text to Image" located at the top-left.
     - Description: "Turn text into personalized avatars" positioned below the title.
     - Icon: Small icon of a sheet of paper. Positioned at the top-right inside the container.
   - **Face Me:**
     - Container: Rectangular box with no border. Positioned below "Text to Image", taking the full width minus margins.
     - Title: "Face Me" located at the top-left.
     - Description: "Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text." positioned below the title.
     - Icon: Small icon of a clock with a face. Positioned at the top-right inside the container.

3. **Button:**
   - Text: "Next" centered inside the button.
   - Background: Blue rectangle.
   - Positioned below the "Face Me" feature list item with some spacing in between.

4. **Ad Section:**
   - Container: Rectangular box with a light grey background. Positioned below the "Next" button.
   - Ad content: Placeholder items for the ad content including blurred texts and boxes.
   - Loading Text: "Loading..." centered in the lower portion of the ad section.

### Describe Functionality:

1. **Status Bar:**
   - Displays essential information such as time, cellular signal, WiFi signal, and battery status.

2. **Question Text:**
   - Informs the user about the selection task.

3. **Feature List Items:**
   - **AI Art:** Selecting this may lead to a feature that allows picture enhancements with face swapping.
   - **AI Enhance:** Selecting this may lead to a feature that enhances image quality.
   - **AI Avatar:** Selecting this may lead to a feature that transforms selfies into avatars.
   - **Text to Image:** Selecting this may lead to a feature that converts text into personalized avatars.
   - **Face Me:** Selecting this may lead to a feature (description suggests a placeholder).

4. **Button:**
   - "Next" button will likely proceed to the next step in the process.

5. **Ad Section:**
   - Displays an advertisement with placeholder content and a loading message, suggesting the ad is not fully loaded.

### Detect Repetition:

1. **Feature List Items:**
   - The structure of each feature list item is repeated: title at the top-left, description below the title, and an icon at the top-right within a rectangular container.
   - Differences exist in title, description, and icons, but the layout remains consistent across all items.
